<report>
<title>Incidence rate comparison</title>
<table>
<tr><td></td><td><subtotal>Exposure:</subtotal></td><td></td><td></td></tr>
<tr><td><subtotal>Outcome:</subtotal></td><td>Exposed</td><td>Non-exposed</td><td>Total</td></tr>
<tr><td>Cases</td><td>@a_out</td><td>@b_out</td><td>@m</td></tr>
<tr><td>Person-time</td><td>@pt1_out</td><td>@pt2_out</td><td>@pt</td></tr>
</table>

<p>Exposed incidence rate = @{ir1:roundu}<br />
Non-exposed incidence rate = @{ir2:roundu}</p>

<p>Rate difference = @{ird:roundu}<br />
<ci>approximate @{pc:round2}% confidence interval = @{ird_from:roundu} to  @{ird_to:roundu}</ci></p>

<p>chi-square = @{xmh:roundu}  <pval>@{p:pval}</pval></p>

<p>Rate ratio = @{irr:roundu}</p>
<block name="exact">
<p><ci>exact @{pc:round2}% confidence interval = @{irr_from:roundu} to  @{irr_to:roundu}</ci></p>

<p>Conditional maximum likelihood estimate of rate ratio = @{eor:roundu}<br />
<ci>Exact Fisher @{pc:round2}% confidence interval = @{llf:roundu} to  @{ulf:roundu}</ci><br />
<pval>Exact Fisher one sided @{p1f:pval}, two sided @{p2f:pval}</pval><br />
<ci>Exact mid-P @{pc:round2}% confidence interval = @{llm:roundu} to  @{ulm:roundu}</ci><br />
<pval>Exact mid-P one sided @{p1m:pval}, two sided @{p2m:pval}</pval></p>
</block>
</report>
